<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0460_T03_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You been to the Pewter Block?\rThe Block Boss use Rock homies. And\nhe got his eyes closed. ALWAYS.\fCreepy.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0460_T03_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">At night, CLEFAIRY come out to play\nat Mt. Moon. But not every night.\fThey got schedules. Union rules.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0460_T03_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ah, you came from Johto?\rThat bring back memories.\rWhen I was young, I went to Johto to\ntrain. And to run from a girl.\rYou remind me of me as a young man.\nBroke, but determined.\rHere. Somethin’ I found in Johto.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0460_T03_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">garbage</attribute>
		<language name="English"></language>
		<language name="日本語">XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0460_T03_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">garbage</attribute>
		<language name="English"></language>
		<language name="日本語">XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0460_T03_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Seein’ new places and meetin’ new\npeople... That’s the joy of travel.\fAnd gettin’ lost. And losin’ luggage.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0460_T03_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Steven: Looks like LATIOS got\ndrawn to it in no time!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0460_T03_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Steven: Looks like LATIAS got\ndrawn to it in no time!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0460_T03_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I can feel LATIOS full of\nfightin’ spirit!\rI’d love to scrap it,\nbut I’ma let you go for it!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0460_T03_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I can feel LATIAS full of\nfightin’ spirit!\rI’d love to scrap it,\nbut I’ma let you go for it!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0460_T03_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">LATIOS: Shuaaaann!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0460_T03_00011" index="11">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">LATIAS: Huaaaaann!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0460_T03_00012" index="12">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">LATIOS flew off into the sky...\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0460_T03_00013" index="13">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">LATIAS flew off into the sky...\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0460_T03_00014" index="14">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Steven: Impressive!\nThat was a great scrap!\rI don’t think you even gave\nit everythin’ you got,\fand that scare me...\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0460_T03_00015" index="15">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I been gone from the Hoenn Big League\ntoo long. They gon’ fire me.\rI gotta excuse myself.\r..................\rOh, I never got your name.\f...But I won’t ask this time.\rOur fun gon’ gotta wait.\nI’ll be lookin’ at rocks. As one does.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0460_T03_00016" index="16">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Steven: Impressive!\nThat was a great scrap!\rLATIOS gon’ be back once it heal\nup to make up for the L.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0460_T03_00017" index="17">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Steven: Impressive!\nThat was a great scrap!\rLATIAS gon’ be back once it heal\nup to make up for the L.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0460_T03_00018" index="18">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Steven: I see. You’d rather hide your\ntrue strength.\rYou got room to breathe, and that\nSCARE me. And I’m the Hoenn Champion.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0460_T03_00019" index="19">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Steven: What? You ain’t scared,\nare you? Don’t be shy. Go for it.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0460_T03_00020" index="20">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Pewter City\nRocks. Mountains. Rocks.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0460_T03_00021" index="21">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Pewter City Block\nBoss: Brock\fRock-Solid. Eyes Always Closed.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0460_T03_00022" index="22">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Pewter Museum of Science</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0460_T03_00023" index="23">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Welcome to Pewter City!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0460_T03_00024" index="24">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The door locked...</language>
	</row>
</body>
